Overlay patch 0033: gNoCulling guard for the one unguarded cull site.

The Moo Moo Farm cow renderer is the only is_within_render_distance caller
that ignores gNoCulling (audit 2026-07-21: 24 sites guarded, this one not).
With gNoCulling=1 now seeded as the iOS default (shell DefaultsVersion v6),
cows would remain the last angle-culled — and thus edge-flickering — actor.
Same guard style as the sibling sites.


--- a/src/racing/actors.c
+++ b/src/racing/actors.c
@@ -538,6 +538,9 @@
         sp88[2] = var_s1->pos[2];
         temp_f0 = is_within_render_distance(camera->pos, sp88, camera->rot[1], 0.0f, camera->fieldOfView,
                                             4000000.0f);
+        if (CVarGetInteger("gNoCulling", 0) == 1) {
+            temp_f0 = MAX(temp_f0, 0.0f);
+        }
         if (temp_f0 > 0.0f) {
             if (temp_f0 < D_8015F704) {
                 D_8015F704 = temp_f0;
